"text": "Yes, for a real remodel. The city's permit FAQ lists kitchen and bathroom remodels among the typical projects that need a permit. Painting, flooring, and replacing a plug-in appliance are on its no-permit list, and cabinetry is only permit-free when it is not part of a kitchen or bathroom remodel. We handle the permitting process for you."
