"@type": "Question",
"name": "Can my range hood vent outside in a Boynton Beach condo?",
"acceptedAnswer": {
"@type": "Answer",
"text": "It depends on the building. Some buildings have a route for exterior venting and many do not, which leaves a recirculating hood. We confirm it with the association before the cooking wall is designed, because it affects the range you can specify and where it can sit."
